# Env BACKUPS. .env itself was already ignored, but timestamped copies made
# before edits (.env.bak-crlf-…, .env.bak-prebyok-…) were NOT, and they hold the
# same live DATABASE_URL / LIVEKIT_API_SECRET / provider keys /
# CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY as the original.
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
*.env.bak*

# Source/config backups left beside the file they shadow.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig

# Generated artifacts: call recordings (REAL customer audio — PII), audio/
